    "wikipedia_summary": "<i><b>Malva olbia</b></i> (previously known as <i>Lavatera olbia</i>), the <b>garden tree mallow</b>, is a species of flowering plant in the family Malvaceae. It is native to the western Mediterranean, and has been introduced to California. A vigorous perennial shrub reaching 2.5 m (8 ft), the Royal Horticultural Society considers it to be a good plant to attract pollinators.",
